Aerie-Purpose: Give the Aerie Guard page the strings of its filter list catalogue: the headings, the search field, the name and description of every list, and the licence and website lines.
Aerie-Upstream-Area: chrome/browser/ui/webui/settings (settings_localized_strings_provider.cc)
Aerie-Kind: hook

Issue #105. The messages are in the overlay's aerie_guard_settings_strings.grdp, which
adblock/0022 already includes. This patch hands each one to the Settings page in a function
of its own, so it does not share context lines with the tables of adblock/0022 and adblock/0027.
The name and description of a list are looked up by its catalogue id on the page
(aerieGuardCatTitle_<id>, aerieGuardCatDesc_<id>). A test compares the names with the grdp and
with components/aerie_adblock/catalogue.json.

--- a/chrome/browser/ui/webui/settings/settings_localized_strings_provider.cc
+++ b/chrome/browser/ui/webui/settings/settings_localized_strings_provider.cc
@@ -1729,6 +1729,55 @@
   html_source->AddLocalizedStrings(kLocalizedStrings);
 }
 
